    eri "Well, we're almost all here."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:303
translate english c18s001_Dinner_51ac705b:

    # mom "Sí, en cuanto lleguen el resto podemos empezar a cenar."
    mom "Yes, we can start dining as soon as the rest of them arrive."

