    nor "No, today is a day for the girls and you. We're staying home after a couple of busy days."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:309
translate english c18s001_Dinner_c2bc9d65:

    # mom "Yo aún tengo que acabar algunas cosas que quiero que reposen para la comida de mañana."
    mom "I still have to finish some things for tomorrow's lunch. I want them to settle for some hours."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:311
translate english c18s001_Dinner_24e9c147:

    # dap "Yo he intentado convencerlas, pero todas han puesto alguna excusa."
    dap "I tried to convince them, but they all made some excuse."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:313
translate english c18s001_Dinner_09375bce:

    # emm "Ya sabéis cómo es esto. Llegas a los 25 y ya no quieres salir a bailar."
    emm "You know how it is. You reach 25 and you don't want to go out dancing anymore."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:314
translate english c18s001_Dinner_ea0646d3:

