    kat "Amanda, Eva, Kim, Debbie, Lisa, Saira, Erika, Daphne, Scarlett, Emma, me and... and me. I get double-counted because I use the space of two of these skinny girls. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:321
translate english c18s001_Dinner_94068f58:

    # kat "Eileen decidirá cuando acabe de trabajar, por si está muy cansada."
    kat "Eileen will decide when she's done working, in case she's too tired."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:322
translate english c18s001_Dinner_cbbde96e:

