    mc "There are twelve or thirteen of us then. We'll need all three cars."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:324
translate english c18s001_Dinner_e276d1ad:

    # ama "Yo puedo conducir uno de los coches, si queréis."
    ama "I can drive one of the cars, if you wish."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:326
translate english c18s001_Dinner_de32ddfe:

    # eri "Yo conduciré el otro. Después de la última vez que salimos, hoy no pienso beber. *Risa*"
    eri "I'll drive the other one. After the last time we went out, I don't plan on drinking today. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:328
translate english c18s001_Dinner_15310c14:

    # eva "A veces me alegra que viváis en California. En cualquier otro estado solo [mc] y Eileen podrían beber."
    eva "Sometimes I'm glad you live in California. In any other state, only [mc] and Eileen could drink."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:329
translate english c18s001_Dinner_5068d387:

    # eva "Suerte que Arnold cambió esa ley absurda. Os podéis alistar en el ejército y matar gente en nombre de vuestro país con 18 pero no beber hasta los 21."
    eva " You are lucky Arnold changed that absurd law. You can enlist in the army and kill people in the name of your country at 18 but not drink until you're 21!"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:331
translate english c18s001_Dinner_2c6c3e94:

