    kim "There's a lot of reasons for that, girls..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:335
translate english c18s001_Dinner_f93664d8:

    # "Empieza una conversación sobre las implicaciones de beber alcohol a diversas edades que se alarga durante la cena."
    "A conversation about the implications of drinking alcohol at various ages begins and extends through the dinner."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:336
translate english c18s001_Dinner_34df7fe0:

    # "[emm] ve bien que dejen beber a los 18. Si eres responsable para votar, también lo debes ser para beber. Ella nunca votaría a un gobernador que quisiera quitarle ese derecho."
    "[emm] sees it as okay to let people drink at 18. If you're responsible for voting, you should also be responsible for drinking. She would never vote for a governor who wanted to take away that right from her."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:337
translate english c18s001_Dinner_6b9a024e:

    # "[eri] es un poco más ambivalente. Su última experiencia con el alcohol le hace ser más prudente."
    "[eri] has mixed opinions about it. Her latest experience with alcohol makes her more cautious."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:338
translate english c18s001_Dinner_22e59bec:

    # "[mar] y [nor], y más tarde Meemaw y Kiara, creen que devolver la edad para beber a los 21 sería lo correcto."
    "[mar] and [nor], and later Meemaw and Kiara, believe that returning the drinking age to 21 would be the right thing to do."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:339
translate english c18s001_Dinner_51783b5f:

    # "Ninguna de ellas pudo beber legalmente hasta los 21 y no creen que les haya perjudicado."
    "None of them were able to legally drink until they were 21, and they don't believe it harmed them."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:340
translate english c18s001_Dinner_1cb834ff:

    # "Eva y Amanda hablan de cuando estuvieron en una misión en Burkina Faso con 14 años y pudieron beber alcohol con normalidad."
    "Eva and Amanda talk about when they were on a mission in Burkina Faso at the age of 14 and were able to drink alcohol normally."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:341
translate english c18s001_Dinner_19bda271:

    # "Eva se emborrachó."
    "Eva got drunk."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:342
translate english c18s001_Dinner_58751903:

    # "Pero lo consideran una buena experiencia que les permitió empezar a conocer sus límites."
    "But they consider it a good experience which allowed them to start to know their limits."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:343
translate english c18s001_Dinner_8ddf32b1:

    # "Betty considera que 16 debería ser suficiente para empezar a beber cerveza y vino, y 18 para licores. Sus experiencias en África han moldeado sus opiniones."
    "Betty considers that 16 should be enough to start drinking beer and wine, and 18 for spirits. Her experiences in Africa have shaped her judgement."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:344
translate english c18s001_Dinner_117dd69b:

    # "El resto de las chicas no tienen una opinión muy estricta en esto. Ven ventajas y desventajas en las diferentes edades."
    "The rest of the girls don't have a very strong opinion on this. They see advantages and disadvantages at different ages."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:345
translate english c18s001_Dinner_81d2d6e6:

    # "Cuando ya no queda comida en los platos, el Unter de Megan llega para llevarla al trabajo."
    "When there's no food left on the plates, Megan's Unter arrives to take her to work."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:346
translate english c18s001_Dinner_df7018af:

    # "Las diferentes conversaciones continúan durante poco menos de una hora más, hasta que llega Eileen, que dice estar muy cansada para ir a bailar."
    "The various conversations continue for just under another hour, until Eileen arrives, who says she is too tired to go dancing."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:348
translate english c18s001_Dinner_c3fc4b3d:

    # sai "Nos deberíamos ir yendo o se hará muy tarde, ¿no?"
    sai "We should get going or it's going to be very late, shouldn't we?"

