    mc "Whenever you want. But you'll have to tell me where we're going to, if I have to drive there."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:351
translate english c18s001_Dinner_f2d7f480:

    # lis "Bueno, vamos a ir al Jazz Corner, donde trabaja Megan."
    lis "Well, we're going to the Jazz Corner, where Megan works."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:352
translate english c18s001_Dinner_16829b31:

    # mc "Ah, OK. Sé dónde está. ¿Y ese era todo el secretismo?"
    mc "Ah, OK. I know where it is. So, what was with all the secrecy?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:354
translate english c18s001_Dinner_1623422f:

    # dap "No es que fuera secretismo, es que queríamos atar un par de cosas antes de ir."
    dap "It's not that it was a secret, it's just that we needed to tie up a couple of things before we could go."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:355
translate english c18s001_Dinner_3824888d:

    # dap "Nadie había reservado la sala anexa hoy, y Megan ha conseguido que nos la dejen para nosotros."
    dap "No one booked the annex lounge today, and Megan has managed to get it for us."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:356
translate english c18s001_Dinner_e0900dec:

    # dap "Si no hubiéramos podido cogerla, una mesa para doce o trece hubiera sido difícil de conseguir y hubiéramos ido al Twins."
    dap "If we hadn't been able to get it, a table for twelve or thirteen would have been hard to get, and then we would have gone to the Twins."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:357
translate english c18s001_Dinner_aa6fe3a4:

    # mc "Pero una sala para nosotros en un local así tiene que salir carísima, ¿no?"
    mc "But a hall for us in a place like that has to be very expensive, right?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:359
translate english c18s001_Dinner_9d8ff7a1:

    # emm "Son las ventajas de conocer a la cantante titular. *Risa* Nos la ha conseguido gratis, pero tendremos que ir a la barra de la sala principal a por las copas."
    emm " Those are the perks of knowing the titular singer. *Laugh* She got it for us for free, but we'll have to go to the bar in the main hall for the drinks."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:360
translate english c18s001_Dinner_84323f0a:

    # mc "Traducción: [mc], te va a tocar ir a por las copas."
    mc "Translation: [mc], you're going to go for the drinks."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:362
translate english c18s001_Dinner_1f921612:

    # sca "¡Como siempre! *Risa* Pero ya te acompañaré yo, como la última vez."
    sca "As always! *Laugh* But I'll be there with you to help, just like the last time."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:363
translate english c18s001_Dinner_fd746a20:

    # mc "Bueno, pues podemos irnos cuando queráis."
    mc "Well, we can leave whenever you want, then."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:365
translate english c18s001_Dinner_c131f3f1:

    # "Os despedís de las mujeres que se quedan en casa y unos minutos después estáis en el Jazz Corner. Megan os acompaña a la sala anexa."
    "You say goodbye to the women who stay at home and a few minutes later you are at the Jazz Corner. Megan escorts you to the annex hall."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:366
translate english c18s001_Dinner_02a98b0b:

    # "La sala es un poco más grande que la mitad de la sala principal y cuenta con su propio escenario y barra, aunque hoy no están en uso."
    "The ballroom is a little larger than half the size of the main hall and has its own stage and bar, although they are not in use today."

