translate english c18s001_Dinner_2e0c3ba5:

    # "En el escenario hay una pantalla dónde proyectarán las actuaciones de Megan en la sala principal."
    "On the stage there is a screen where they will project Megan's performances in the main room."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:374
translate english c18s001_Dinner_63f66d91:

    # "Amanda, con un vestido que le ha prestado [emm]. Ella había venido en shorts a casa."
    "Amanda, in a dress she borrowed from [emm]. She came home in shorts for lunch."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:378
translate english c18s001_Dinner_81ea5029:

    # "[dap], otra vez con el pelo suelto, como la noche del Twins."
    "[dap], again with her hair loose, just like the night at the Twins."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:382
translate english c18s001_Dinner_c99372e2:

    # "Debbie. Parece que les ha cogido el gusto a los tops."
    "Debbie. She seems to have taken a liking to tops."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:386
translate english c18s001_Dinner_953e654f:

    # "[emm] con un vestido un poco osado que le ha prestado Kim."
    "[emm] in a slightly daring dress she borrowed from Kim."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:390
translate english c18s001_Dinner_f204cdfa:

    # "[eri]. fiel a su estilo."
    "[eri], true to her style."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:394
translate english c18s001_Dinner_fe85c8ee:

    # "Eva. Simplemente alucinante."
    "Eva. Simply breathtaking."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:398
translate english c18s001_Dinner_6547b59d:

    # "Kate, un vestido cómodo y sencillo, en su línea."
    "Kate, a comfortable and simple dress, very much in her style."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:402
translate english c18s001_Dinner_1df18a38:

    # "Kim. Hablando de vestidos osados."
    "Kim. Talk about daring dresses."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:406
translate english c18s001_Dinner_e92781d9:

    # "Lisa, también manteniendo su estilo. Si el vestido fuera más largo podría ir a la ópera con él."
    "Lisa, also true to her style. If the dress were longer, she could go to the opera in it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:410
translate english c18s001_Dinner_6283af77:

    # "Megan. El vestuario que le eligen es espectacular."
    "Megan. The wardrobe the club chooses for her is spectacular."

