    "Scarlett, in another dress borrowed from Kim."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:423
translate english c18s001_Dinner_073ecb12:

    # meg "Y esta es la sala. Por aquella puerta podéis pasar a la sala principal a pedir las bebidas. Acordaos del código para poder volver a entrar."
    meg "And this is the hall. Through that door, you can go to the main room to order drinks. Remember the code so you can go back in."

