    eri "What? When?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:916
translate english c18s001_Erika_10043148:

    # mc "Ya sabe que estoy con alguien de la familia. Ladró un poco, pero tuvo que aceptarlo."
    mc "She already knows I'm with someone in the family. She barked a little, but she had to accept it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:919
translate english c18s001_Erika_d08fb9a3:

    # eri "¿Qué? ¿Cuándo? No sabía que a [emm] también se le hubiera escapado con ella."
    eri "What? When? I didn't know [emm] spilled the beans with her, too."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:921
translate english c18s001_Erika_039eb2b1:

    # eri "¿Qué? ¿Cuándo? No voy a preguntar con quién..."
    eri "What? When? I'm not going to ask with whom..."

