    mc "The day we had the meeting with Aaron, Amanda, and Eva."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:928
translate english c18s001_Erika_36163494:

    # eri "Entonces creo que estoy preparada para hacerlo público. El martes sería un buen día."
    eri "Then I think I'm ready to go public. Tuesday would be a good day."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:930
translate english c18s001_Erika_68bc9a3f:

    # mc "Sigo pensando que le tenéis demasiado miedo. ¿Qué va a hacer? Ladrar un poco y aceptar lo que es un hecho sobre el que no tiene ningún control."
    mc "I still think you guys are too afraid of her. What is she going to do? Bark a little and accept what is a fact over which she has no control."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:932
translate english c18s001_Erika_5d30da47:

    # eri "Tienes razón. Creo que estoy preparada para hacerlo público. El martes sería un buen día."
    eri "You are right. I think I'm ready to go public. Tuesday would be a good day."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:933
translate english c18s001_Erika_1c58d10f:

    # eri "Y si ese test sale positivo, soltamos las dos cosas a la vez."
    eri "And if that test turns out positive, we drop both news at the same time."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:934
translate english c18s001_Erika_84ab91bc:

    # mc "Me parece una buena idea. *Risa* No le habrá dado tiempo de recuperarse de las emociones de los cumpleaños."
    mc "Sounds like a good idea. *Laugh* She may not have had time to recover from the emotions of the birthdays."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:936
translate english c18s001_Erika_1647a260:

    # eri "Olvida lo del martes..."
    eri "Forget what I said about Tuesday..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:937
translate english c18s001_Erika_c5659800:

    # eri "Mejor no pongamos fecha o estaré nerviosa hasta que llegue."
    eri "We'd better not set a date, or I'll be nervous until it arrives."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:938
translate english c18s001_Erika_f85633ad:

    # mc "No hay ningún problema. Solo una pregunta. ¿Se lo quieres decir solo a la familia o a todas las chicas?"
    mc "No problem at all. Just one question - do you want to tell just the family or all the girls?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:940
translate english c18s001_Erika_1d26f527:

