translate english c18s001_Amanda_26640daa:

    # ama "Eva sigue dándole vueltas al beso de anoche. Pero se le pasará."
    ama "Eva is still thinking about last night's kiss. But she will get over it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1170
translate english c18s001_Amanda_39401294:

    # mc "Y tú no la ayudas a olvidarlo acusándola de ponerse ese vestido por mí."
    mc "And you don't help her forget it by accusing her of wearing that dress for me."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1172
translate english c18s001_Amanda_d1473d1b:

    # ama "¿Te lo ha dicho? ¡Chivata!"
    ama "Did she tell you? Snitch!"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1173
translate english c18s001_Amanda_9c9410e3:

    # mc "*Risa* Las dos habéis dicho lo mismo de la otra. ¿Te das cuenta de lo ridículo que suena?"
    mc "*Laugh* You both said the same thing about each other. Do you realize how ridiculous that sounds?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1175
translate english c18s001_Amanda_b4199019:

    # ama "Ahora que lo has dicho... sí. Nos estamos comportando como niñas pequeñas. Todo esto es nuevo para nosotras..."
    ama "Now that you've said it... yes. We are behaving like little girls. This is all new to us..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1176
translate english c18s001_Amanda_3ed72d83:

    # mc "No pasa nada, Amanda. Pero no dejéis que os separe."
    mc "It's okay, Amanda. But don't let it split you up."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1177
translate english c18s001_Amanda_85ef00a7:

    # mc "Además..."
    mc "Besides that..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1179
translate english c18s001_Amanda_9725d714:

    # mc "*Susurrando* Tú también estás preciosa con ese vestido."
    mc "*Whispering* You look beautiful in that dress, too."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1181
translate english c18s001_Amanda_6efc6087:

    # ama "¿De verdad lo crees? Gracias... Me lo ha prestado [emm], usamos casi la misma talla... *Risa* Lógicamente."
    ama "Do you really think so? Thank you... I borrowed it from [emm], we wear almost the same size... *Laugh* Logically."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1182
translate english c18s001_Amanda_256a28c5:

    # mc "Aunque sea un vestido prestado estás tan bonita como cualquier otra chica esta noche. No puedo esperar a verte con un vestido elegido por ti."
    mc "Even if it's a borrowed dress you look as pretty as any other girl tonight. I can't wait to see you in a dress of your choice."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1184
translate english c18s001_Amanda_7447d7c3:

    # ama "Me vas a hacer ruborizar."
    ama "You're going to make me blush."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1185
translate english c18s001_Amanda_6f9744b0:

    # mc "Bueno, el estilo de Eva es el de una espía devora hombres. Quiero saber cuál es el tuyo. Seguro que estarás preciosa."
    mc "Well, Eva's style is that of a man-eating spy. I want to know what yours is. I'm sure you'll look beautiful."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1187
translate english c18s001_Amanda_9225161a:

    # ama "¿Crees que debería ir a hablar con Eva? ¿Dejar las cosas claras?"
    ama "Do you think I should go talk to Eva? Set the record straight?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1188
translate english c18s001_Amanda_a6f7a5dd:

    # mc "No lo sé. Tú la conoces mejor que yo. Si fuera [emm] yo lo haría."
    mc "I don't know. You know her better than I do. If she were [emm], I would do it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1189
translate english c18s001_Amanda_34a79bc4:

    # ama "Es que es la primera vez que estamos en esta situación. Nunca nos hemos peleado por un chico."
    ama "It's just that this is the first time we've been in this situation. We've never fought over a man."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1191
translate english c18s001_Amanda_6a4462aa:

    # ama "¡Oh! ¡Mierda! ¡Olvida lo que he dicho!"
    ama "Oh! Shit! Forget what I said!"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1192
translate english c18s001_Amanda_d9be5c9f:

    # mc "No he oído nada."
    mc "I didn't hear anything."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1193
translate english c18s001_Amanda_b9270f79:

    # mcp "(Pero supongo que lo que no he oído responde a mi pregunta sobre si estabas flirteando conmigo.)"
    mcp "(But I guess what I didn't hear answers my question about whether you were flirting with me.)"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1195
translate english c18s001_Amanda_e5fd1794:

    # ama "Creo que voy a hablar con ella. Lisa es la siguiente."
    ama "I think I'm going to talk to her. Lisa's next."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1196
translate english c18s001_Amanda_1f4f4bb7:

    # mc "Arregladlo antes de que se enquiste. Voy a ver a Lisa."
    mc "Fix it before it starts festering. I'm going to see Lisa."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1198
translate english c18s001_Amanda_05648a53:

    # ama "{i}(¿Cómo puedo haber sido tan tonta como para que se me escape? Al menos ahora la pelota está en tu tejado, [mc].){/i}"
    ama "{i}(How could I have been so foolish as to let it slip out? At least now the ball is in your court, [mc].){/i}"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1204
translate english c18s001_Lisa_35e16f45:

    # mcp "(Lisa me cae bien, pero yo a ella no. ¿Debería sacarla a bailar?)"
    mcp "(I like Lisa, but she doesn't like me. Should I ask her to dance?)"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1205
translate english c18s001_Lisa_9396281d:

    # mcp "(Quizás sea una oportunidad para conocernos mejor.)"
    mcp "(Perhaps this is an opportunity to get to know each other better.)"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1215
translate english c18s001_Lisa_a6f47669:

    # mcp "(No quiero que se sienta mal porque no la saque a bailar en su turno.)"
    mcp "(I don't want her to feel bad because I don't ask her to dance in her turn.)"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1217
translate english c18s001_Lisa_2ee04643:

    # mc "Lisa, ¿te apetece bailar?"
    mc "Lisa, do you feel like dancing?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1218
translate english c18s001_Lisa_ea9e4818:

    # lis "Por supuesto. Te veo luego, [dap]."
    lis "Of course. See you later, [dap]."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1220
translate english c18s001_Lisa_5f65dd86:

    # lis "{i}(No quiero que se sienta mal porque yo sea la única que la rechaza.){/i}"
    lis "{i}(I don't want him to feel bad because I'm the only one who rejects him.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1222
translate english c18s001_Lisa_8353e812:

    # lis "{i}(No es tan mal chico como parecía al principio. Quizás me equivoqué juzgándolo.){/i}"
    lis "{i}(He's not as bad a guy as he seemed at first. Maybe I was wrong in judging him.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1224
translate english c18s001_Lisa_79fa0866:

    # lis "{i}(Además está con Debbie. Quizás sea buen momento para conocerlo mejor.){/i}"
    lis "{i}(Plus he's with Debbie. Maybe it's a good time to get to know him better.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1227
translate english c18s001_Lisa_93e3b3d3:

    # mcp "(No quiero que se sienta obligada a bailar conmigo exclusivamente porque lo dice una app.)"
    mcp "(I don't want her to feel compelled to dance with me solely because an app says so.)"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1228
translate english c18s001_Lisa_3f196423:

    # mcp "(Mejor voy a por otro zumo.)"
    mcp "(I better go get another juice.)"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1235
translate english c18s001_Lisa_ddaccb9f:

    # lis "Creo que me toca a mí bailar con el chico de la noche, ¿no?"
    lis "I think it's my turn to dance with the guy of the night, isn't it?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1236
translate english c18s001_Lisa_83b3e321:

    # mc "Eso me han dicho. Pero si no te apetece..."
    mc "That's what I've been told. But if you don't feel like it..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1237
translate english c18s001_Lisa_9e25c035:

    # lis "No te preocupes, me apetece."
    lis "Don't worry, I want to do it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1238
translate english c18s001_Lisa_91b5562f:

    # lis "{i}(Además estás con Debbie. Quizás sea buen momento para conocerte mejor.){/i}"
    lis "{i}(Besides, you're with Debbie. Maybe it's a good time to get to know you better.){/i}"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1240
translate english c18s001_Lisa_583254e8:

    # lis "No soy muy buena bailarina. Me vas a tener que llevar tú."
    lis "I'm not a very good dancer. You're going to have to lead me."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1241
translate english c18s001_Lisa_a7aa7709:

    # mc "*Risa* Si le preguntas a [emm], descubrirás que yo tampoco lo soy."
    mc "*Laugh* If you ask [emm], you'll find out I'm not either."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1242
translate english c18s001_Lisa_cdc622c7:

    # mc "Pero me extraña tanto que chicas de clase alta no hayáis tomado clases de baile. Es lo que se ve en las películas. Danza, piano, y cosas por el estilo."
    mc "But it's such a surprise that you upper-class girls haven't taken dance lessons. That's what you see in the movies. Dance, piano, and things like that."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1244
translate english c18s001_Lisa_b5221f89:

    # mc "Debbie también me ha dicho que era mala bailarina, aunque no me ha pisado ni una vez. *Risa*"
    mc "Debbie also told me she was a bad dancer, although she hasn't stepped on my foot once. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1246
translate english c18s001_Lisa_7b5b9ebe:

    # lis "¿Eh? No os he visto bailar... Me extraña tanto que mi hermana baile con un chico... Me hubiera gustado verlo."
    lis " Huh? I haven't seen you dance... It's so strange to me that my sister dances with a guy... I would have liked to have seen it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1247
translate english c18s001_Lisa_909eac03:

    # mc "Nos hemos cruzado en el guardarropía y hemos bailado allí."
    mc "We crossed paths in the cloakroom and danced there."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1248
translate english c18s001_Lisa_7ad9dbc1:

    # lis "Ah, OK. Un baile privado. Que romántico..."
    lis "Ah, OK. A private dance. That's so romantic..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1250
translate english c18s001_Lisa_214b9b1b:

    # lis "Sobre las clases de baile... Ni Debbie ni yo estábamos interesadas. Mis padres lo intentaron, pero nosotras nos negamos."
    lis "About the dance classes... Neither Debbie nor I were interested. My parents tried, but we refused."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1251
translate english c18s001_Lisa_ddafb0d3:

    # lis "Yo por rebeldía tonta y Debbie porque nunca estuvo interesada. Siempre le interesaron más otras actividades."
    lis "Me because of silly rebelliousness, and Debbie because she was never interested. She was always more interested in other activities."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1252
translate english c18s001_Lisa_557bdbe7:

    # mc "Lo de la rebeldía te pega. *Risa* Y a Debbie lo de estar interesada en los deportes en vez de en la danza."
    mc "The rebelliousness thing fits you. *Laugh* And, as for Debbie, her being interested in sports instead of dance, is no surprise."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1254
translate english c18s001_Lisa_7b1be3a0:

    # lis "*Risa* Sí, la verdad es que no quería ser un cliché de chica de clase alta y acabé siéndolo."
    lis "*Laugh* Yeah, the truth is I didn't want to be a cliché upper-class girl and I ended up being one."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1255
translate english c18s001_Lisa_53c0d3cf:

    # lis "La chica blanca rica que va a manifestaciones del Black Lives Matter y a protestas climáticas."
    lis "The rich white girl who goes to Black Lives Matter rallies and climate protests."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1256
translate english c18s001_Lisa_6a0756a0:

    # mc "Bueno, me parecen buenas causas."
    mc "Well, they sound like good causes to me."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1258
translate english c18s001_Lisa_5459d6e9:

    # lis "Lo son. Pero, en la mayoría de los casos, sirven de muy poco y sólo a nivel local. Alguien debería hacer algo en las esferas políticas."
    lis "They are. But, in most cases, they are of very little use and only at the local level. Someone should do something in the political spheres."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1259
translate english c18s001_Lisa_9c56984a:

    # mc "El problema es encontrar a ese alguien, ¿no? La clase política suele tener demasiados intereses cruzados y estar atada a demasiados lobbies."
    mc "The problem is finding that someone, isn't it? The political class tends to have too many intersecting interests and be tied to too many lobbies."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1261
translate english c18s001_Lisa_06944f43:

    # lis "Sí, y la mayoría de gente concienciada también está muy politizada. El establishment los tacha de comunistas, con lo que es difícil que alguna vez tengan poder."
    lis "Yes, and most conscientious people are also very politicized. The establishment brands them as communists, making it difficult for them to ever have power."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1262
translate english c18s001_Lisa_4f27d2d4:

    # mc "Y los que no estáis politizados, la base de esos movimientos, no estáis interesados en entrar en política. Tú estudias Arte, por ejemplo."
    mc "And those of you who are not politicized, the base of those movements, are not interested in entering politics. You study art, for example."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1264
translate english c18s001_Lisa_f800ee59:

    # lis "*Risa* ¿Me ves como alcaldesa de un pueblo? No es algo para mí."
    lis "*Laugh* Can you see me as mayor of a small town? It's not something for me."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1265
translate english c18s001_Lisa_213b30da:

    # mc "¿Por qué no? ¿Demasiadas responsabilidades? Al menos nadie te podría tachar de comunista."
    mc "Why not? Too many responsibilities? At least no one could label you a communist."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1275
translate english c18s001_Lisa_0692a1e1:

    # mc "Dependiendo de tu programa, obviamente. Sé que, al menos, serías honesta."
    mc "Depending on your program, obviously. I know you would, at least, be honest."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1277
translate english c18s001_Lisa_260b12e0:

    # lis "¡Wow! Eso no me lo esperaba."
    lis "Wow! I didn't expect that."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1278
translate english c18s001_Lisa_ae28686e:

    # mc "¿Por qué no? Ahora que te conozco mejor, creo que podrías hacer un buen trabajo como alcaldesa de donde sea."
    mc "Why not? Now that I know you better, I think you could do a good job as mayor of wherever."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1280
translate english c18s001_Lisa_21301555:

    # lis "No es eso. No me veo ejerciendo la política. ¿Crees que alguien me votaría?"
    lis "It's not that. I can't see myself engaging in politics. Do you think anyone would vote for me?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1282
translate english c18s001_Lisa_754ea9de:

    # mc "No hubiera votado por la Lisa que conocí en el aeropuerto. Pero sí por la que está bailando conmigo ahora mismo."
    mc "I wouldn't have voted for the Lisa I met at the airport. But I would vote for the one dancing with me right now."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1284
translate english c18s001_Lisa_763c6fa5:

    # lis "Me comporté como una imbécil, ¿verdad?"
    lis "I acted like a jerk, didn't I?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1285
translate english c18s001_Lisa_2854b7e8:

    # mc "Yo no diría eso, pero no fue demasiado agradable conocerte aquel día."
    mc "I wouldn't say that, but it wasn't too pleasant meeting you on that day."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1286
translate english c18s001_Lisa_e92b2438:

    # lis "Lo siento..."
    lis "I'm sorry..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1287
translate english c18s001_Lisa_18193b19:

    # mc "Un mal día lo tiene cualquiera. Nos has demostrado a todos que aquella Lisa no eras tú."
    mc "Anybody can have a bad day. You've shown us all that the Lisa at the airport wasn't the real you."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1288
translate english c18s001_Lisa_be61b8d6:

    # mc "Si dejas que la gente te conozca, ¿por qué no te van a votar?"
    mc "If you let people get to know you, why won't they vote for you?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1290
translate english c18s001_Lisa_16a151df:

    # lis "Se necesitan muchas cosas que no tengo. Carisma, contactos, pertenecer a un partido... Además, como has dicho, estudio Arte. No una carrera que tenga que ver con la política."
    lis "You need a lot of things that I don't have. Charisma, contacts, belonging to a party... Besides, as you said, I study Art. Not a career that has anything to do with politics."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1291
translate english c18s001_Lisa_eeedd398:

    # mc "Tuvimos a Arnold como gobernador aquí. *Risa* No estoy seguro de que estudiara algo relacionado con la política."
    mc "We had Arnold as Governor here. *Laugh* I'm not sure he studied anything related to politics."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1293
translate english c18s001_Lisa_949c3047:

    # lis "*Risa* Es verdad, los californianos sois raros. Elegís a un actor como gobernador."
    lis "*Laugh* It's true, you Californians are weird. You can elect an actor as Governor."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1294
translate english c18s001_Lisa_1e9b5f62:

    # mc "*Risa* Los americanos somos raros. Elegimos a un actor como presidente... *Risa* Un actor que antes fue gobernador de California."
    mc "*Laugh* We Americans are weird. We elected an actor as President... *Laugh* An actor who was a former Governor of California."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1295
translate english c18s001_Lisa_918bef6f:

    # lis "*Risa* Es verdad. Al menos él ganó la Guerra Fría. ¿Qué hizo Arnold?"
    lis "*Laugh* It's true. At least he won the Cold War. What did Arnold do?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1296
translate english c18s001_Lisa_dc7175bc:

    # mc "Permitirte beber alcohol esta noche. *Risa*"
    mc "Allow you to drink alcohol tonight. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1297
translate english c18s001_Lisa_3382fe0e:

    # lis "*Risa* Punto para Arnold."
    lis "*Laugh* Point for Arnold."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1300
translate english c18s001_Lisa_236c7e34:

    # lis "Sé que esto va a sonarte raro, pero ¿podemos hablar de Debbie?"
    lis "I know this is going to sound weird to you, but can we talk about Debbie?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1301
translate english c18s001_Lisa_81e2e7ad:

    # mc "Lo que quieras. Es tu hermana y tienes todo el derecho a hablar de ella."
    mc "Whatever you want. She's your sister and you have every right to talk about her."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1303
translate english c18s001_Lisa_6b37feed:

    # lis "Me preocupa cómo se siente. Cómo la haces sentir."
    lis "I'm concerned about how she feels. How you make her feel."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1304
translate english c18s001_Lisa_d13e97a4:

    # mc "Ya te dije que no tengo intención de hacerle daño."
    mc "I told you I have no intention of hurting her."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1306
translate english c18s001_Lisa_61450eff:

    # lis "Lo sé. Pero ayer, mientras me explicaba lo del lago... Nunca la había visto... la palabra que me viene a la cabeza es \"brillar\"... tanto como anoche."
    lis "I know. But yesterday, while she was explaining to me what happened at the lake... I've never seen her before... the word that comes to my mind is \"glowing\"... as much as last night."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1307
translate english c18s001_Lisa_e5462fe1:

    # lis "Está muy ilusionada. Yo estoy muy contenta por ella, pero..."
    lis "She is really enthusiastic. I'm very happy for her, but..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1308
translate english c18s001_Lisa_3a0ccfb7:

    # mc "Y te preocupa que acabe desilusionándola."
    mc "But you're worried that I'll end up disappointing her."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1311
translate english c18s001_Lisa_1138990b:

    # lis "Me ha dicho que estás saliendo con más chicas aparte de ella. Eso de por sí me desconcertó. Que lo hagas y que ella lo acepte me desconcierta aún más."
    lis "She told me you're dating more girls besides her. That in itself puzzled me. That you do that, and that she accepts it baffles me even more."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1312
translate english c18s001_Lisa_b04b9f66:

    # mc "Sí, estoy saliendo con más chicas. Pero no engaño a nadie. Para mí, cada una de ellas es igual de importante."
    mc "Yes, I'm dating more girls. But I'm not cheating on anyone. To me, each of them is equally important."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1314
translate english c18s001_Lisa_04b2decd:

    # lis "Me preocupa que puedas acabar haciéndole daño sin querer. Sé que no vas a hacerlo a propósito."
    lis "I'm worried that you might end up hurting her unintentionally. I know you're not going to do it on purpose."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1315
translate english c18s001_Lisa_493919a2:

    # mc "Te prometo que voy a ir con todo el cuidado posible para evitar que eso pase."
    mc "I promise you I'm going to go as carefully as I can to prevent that from happening."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1316
translate english c18s001_Lisa_3e206ce6:

    # mc "Debbie es muy especial y la voy a tratar como se merece."
    mc "Debbie is very special and I'm going to treat her the way she deserves."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1319
translate english c18s001_Lisa_fe0ef7cc:

    # lis "¿Puedo preguntar cómo funciona eso de salir con más de una chica?"
    lis "May I ask how that works, dating more than one girl?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1320
translate english c18s001_Lisa_4ecac2b6:

    # mc "Es muy fácil. Yo soy capaz de amar a diversas chicas a la vez. Pero cuando estoy con cualquiera de ellas, el resto no existe."
    mc "It's really simple. I am capable of loving several girls at once. But when I'm with any one of them, the rest doesn't exist."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1321
translate english c18s001_Lisa_ae0e301e:

    # mc "Cuando estaba con tu hermana en guardarropía, no importaba si salía con alguna de las chicas que había aquí fuera, en casa, o en cualquier otro lado."
    mc "When I was with your sister in the cloakroom, it didn't matter if I was dating any of the girls out here, at home, or anywhere else."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1323
translate english c18s001_Lisa_ec3019a0:

    # lis "*Risa* Lo has dicho de una forma en que es imposible saber con quién más sales."
    lis "*Laugh* You said it in a way that makes it impossible to know who else you're dating."

