    kim "It's normal. You've been going girl on girl all night."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1491
translate english c18s001_Kim_88e51aa7:

    # kim "Ya te dije que no había nada de lo que hablar."
    kim "I told you there was nothing to talk about."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1492
translate english c18s001_Kim_cf573686:

    # mc "Y dijiste que esto de estar formando una familia podría evitar que tú y yo... y ahí lo dejaste."
    mc "And you said this thing about starting a family might keep you and me... and that's where you left it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1494
translate english c18s001_Kim_e397ee2f:

    # kim "No debería haberlo dicho."
    kim "I shouldn't have said that."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1495
translate english c18s001_Kim_d2970102:

    # mc "Sabes que, aunque estemos formando una familia, los típicos tabús familiares no se nos aplican, ¿verdad? A ti y a mí."
    mc "You know that, even though we're starting a family, the typical family taboos don't apply to us, right? To you and me."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1497
translate english c18s001_Kim_92cf4f70:

    # mc "Con el beso de la playa dijiste que te sentías atraída por mí."
    mc "With the kiss on the beach you said you were attracted to me."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1499
translate english c18s001_Kim_b7e481bc:

    # mc "Y con mi beso te dije que yo me sentía atraído por ti."
    mc "And with my kiss I told you that I was attracted to you."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1500
translate english c18s001_Kim_62e3685a:

    # mc "¿Dónde ves el problema?"
    mc "Where do you see the problem?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1502
translate english c18s001_Kim_19acc9d3:

    # kim "El problema lo veo en que estamos formando una familia. No voy a decir que te vea como a un hermano ni nada por el estilo."
    kim "The problem I see is that we're starting a family. I'm not going to say I see you as a brother or anything like that."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1503
translate english c18s001_Kim_b6abdbc2:

    # kim "Eres... un miembro más de la familia. Pero también lo es [mar], y no sé cómo vería que me liara con su hijo."
    kim "You're... just another member of the family. But so is [mar], and I don't know how she would feel about me hooking up with her son."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1504
translate english c18s001_Kim_24cf8761:

    # mc "No creo que la opinión de mi madre tenga que influir en lo que hagamos tú y yo."
    mc "I don't think my mother's opinion should have any impact on what you and I do."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1506
translate english c18s001_Kim_92949965:

    # kim "No lo entiendes. Pero influye."
    kim "You don't understand. But it has an impact."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1508
translate english c18s001_Kim_d2c28201:

    # kim "Me gustas, pero tengo que pensar si debo actuar sobre esos sentimientos."
    kim "I like you, but I have to think about whether I should act on those feelings."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1510
translate english c18s001_Kim_825a6cec:

    # kim "Aún no sé si me gustas o me caes mal. Depende del día... pero tengo que pensar si debo actuar sobre esos sentimientos, si es que los tengo."
    kim "I still don't know if I like you or don't. It depends on the day... but I have to think about whether I should act on those feelings, if I have them."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1511
translate english c18s001_Kim_24be633e:

    # mc "Lo entiendo. Una cosa es lo que crea yo y otra diferente lo que creas tú."
    mc "I understand. What I believe is one thing, but you can believe something completely different."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1512
translate english c18s001_Kim_f20f6b5e:

    # kim "¿Podemos cambiar de tema?"
    kim "Can we change the topic?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1513
translate english c18s001_Kim_890c041b:

    # mc "Por supuesto."
    mc "Of course."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1515
translate english c18s001_Kim_e99bebcc:

    # mc "Mañana es el fin de la locura. No me malinterpretes, adoro los cumpleaños de las chicas, especialmente después de haberme perdido los últimos tres..."
    mc "Tomorrow is the end of the madness. Don't get me wrong, I love the girls' birthdays, especially after missing the last three..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1516
translate english c18s001_Kim_458fe098:

    # kim "*Risa* Pero es agotador. Los últimos dos días parece que la vida en casa ha girado en torno a [emm], [eri], [dap] y sus cumpleaños."
    kim "*Laugh* But it's exhausting. The last two days it seems like life at home has revolved around [emm], [eri], [dap], and their birthdays."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1517
translate english c18s001_Kim_99ce5ea2:

    # kim "Incluso la llegada de Eva y Amanda parecía un regalo anticipado para ellas."
    kim "Even Eva and Amanda's arrival seemed like an early gift to them."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1518
translate english c18s001_Kim_cb38f586:

    # mc "Siempre ha sido un fin de semana especial. Pero este año todo parece sobredimensionado."
    mc "It's always been a special weekend. But this year it all seems over the top."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1520
translate english c18s001_Kim_6c3ad41b:

    # kim "Yo las entiendo. Este año estás tú. Están Amanda y Eva. Están Olivia y Betty. Estamos nosotras. Y son el centro de atención de todas."
    kim "I understand them. This year you're here. Amanda and Eva are here. Olivia and Betty are here too. And then, there's us. And they're the center of everyone's attention."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1521
translate english c18s001_Kim_075a4b95:

    # kim "Es como sus cumpleaños de siempre pero hasta las cejas de esteroides."
    kim "It's like their usual birthdays, but on steroids. Like a buffed-up version."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1522
translate english c18s001_Kim_cbd9ac9f:

    # mc "*Risa* Creo que no lo habría podido expresar mejor."
    mc "*Laugh* I don't think I could have expressed it better."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1524
translate english c18s001_Kim_0cdbb488:

    # kim "Espero haber acertado con los regalos. Es complicado acertar... y no podía gastar mucho hasta que no me paguen por el trabajo de la semana que viene."
    kim "I hope I got the gifts right. It's tricky to nail it... and I couldn't spend much until I get paid for next week's work."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1525
translate english c18s001_Kim_bfa186e6:

    # mc "No creo que miren el valor sino la intención."
    mc "I don't think they look at the value but at the intent."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1526
translate english c18s001_Kim_f6767f19:

    # kim "Eso espero..."
    kim "I hope so..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1528
translate english c18s001_Kim_30fbdc48:

    # kim "¡Oh! Acabo de darme cuenta... ¿También son los cumpleaños de Eva y Amanda?"
    kim "Oh! I just realized... It's Eva and Amanda's birthdays too?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1529
translate english c18s001_Kim_143cc74d:

