    mc "No, they were a month or so ago."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1531
translate english c18s001_Kim_ec50ffca:

    # kim "Menos mal... no les había comprado nada."
    kim "Thank goodness... I hadn't bought anything from them."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1532
translate english c18s001_Kim_ab87e77f:

    # mc "Aunque fueran sus cumpleaños, lo entenderían. Las conociste ayer. Pero no te preocupes. Solo son tres cumpleaños. Solo."
    mc "Even if it were their birthdays, they would understand. You met them yesterday. But don't worry. It's only three birthdays. Only."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1534
translate english c18s001_Kim_502b2abc:

    # kim "Ayer... parece que ha pasado una vida entera, pero ayer hizo una semana que llegamos."
    kim "Yesterday... it seems like a lifetime ago, but it was a week ago yesterday that we arrived."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1535
translate english c18s001_Kim_f43ae440:

    # kim "Mudarme a Newport es la mejor decisión que he tomado en mucho tiempo."
    kim "Moving to Newport is the best decision I've made in a long time."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1536
translate english c18s001_Kim_18670915:

    # kim "Vine por el calor y he encontrado el calor de una familia."
    kim "I came for the warmth and have found the warmth of a family."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1537
translate english c18s001_Kim_9f4e825f:

    # mc "Eso te ha quedado... casi poético. Me alegra que te sientas así."
    mc "That came across... almost poetic. I'm glad you feel that way."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1538
translate english c18s001_Kim_5eeaf5f0:

    # mc "Tu familia de Cleveland... ¿has hablado con ellos?"
    mc "Your family in Cleveland... have you talked to them?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1540
translate english c18s001_Kim_8092e0f5:

    # kim "Hablo todos los días y se lo he explicado todo... bueno, menos La Clonversación... y alguna cosa más."
    kim "I talk every day with them, and I've explained everything... well, except for The Clonversation... and some other things."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1541
translate english c18s001_Kim_b5ad180f:

    # kim "Alucinan cuando les hablo de la familia. Dicen que nunca me habían visto adaptándome tan rápido a un sitio."
    kim "They are amazed when I tell them about the family. They say they've never seen me adapt so quickly to a place."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1542
translate english c18s001_Kim_27b9cbcf:

    # mc "¿Te costaba adaptarte? No lo entiendo, eres muy sociable."
    mc "Did you have trouble adjusting? I don't understand, you're very sociable."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1544
translate english c18s001_Kim_90e3b17d:

    # kim "Soy muy sociable porque lo ponéis muy fácil. Nadie juzga a nadie... bueno, quizás Olivia un poco."
    kim "I'm very sociable because you make it so easy. No one judges anyone... well, maybe Olivia a little bit."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1545
translate english c18s001_Kim_e9496f0f:

    # kim "Nadie hace comentarios para hacer daño a nadie. Todo el mundo ayuda a todo el mundo en lo que puede."
    kim "No one makes comments to hurt anyone. Everyone helps everyone in whatever way they can."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1546
translate english c18s001_Kim_087f7674:

    # kim "Y después estás tú. Parece que estás en todos sitios cuando alguna de nosotras te necesitamos."
    kim "And then there's you. You seem to be everywhere when any of us need you."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1547
translate english c18s001_Kim_a13ee82f:

    # mc "Era una de mis funciones cuando erais solo clientas... eso ha sonado muy mal. *Risa*"
    mc "It was one of my functions when you were just clients...that sounded better in my head. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1548
translate english c18s001_Kim_143dc688:

    # mc "Ahora, además, lo hago por pasar tiempo con vosotras."
    mc "Now, also, I do it to spend time with you."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1550
translate english c18s001_Kim_fd10106e:

    # kim "Y nosotras te lo agradecemos. Mucho."
    kim "And we appreciate it. A lot."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1551
translate english c18s001_Kim_271c2c3d:

    # kim "Es difícil tener una conversación con cualquiera de las chicas en la que no se hable de ti tarde o temprano."
    kim "It's hard to have a conversation with any of the girls where you don't get talked about sooner or later."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1552
translate english c18s001_Kim_10832dd0:

    # kim "No es que seas el centro de cada conversación, aún estamos en ese momento en que nos quedan planes y sueños que compartir, pero sueles aparecer en muchas de ellas."
    kim "It's not that you're the center of every conversation, we're still at that point where we have plans and dreams left to share, but you tend to show up in a lot of them."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1553
