    kim "I know. But I almost expected you to keep talking... to try to convince me to make a decision..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1578
translate english c18s001_Kim_ce2d76a2:

    # kim "Ahora ha pasado el momento, pero en ese momento lo esperaba."
    kim "Now the moment has gone by, but, at the time, I expected it."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:1579
translate english c18s001_Kim_992a26ad:

    # mc "No voy a forzarte a tomar una decisión, Kim. Es algo que tienes que pensar tú y llegar a tus propias conclusiones."
    mc "I'm not going to force you to make a decision, Kim. It's something you have to think about and come to your own conclusions."

