translate english c18s003_Daphne_9c02d355:

    # sca "Si no os molesta, yo os acompañaré. Mientras la ballena se hace las pruebas, yo podre lucir tipito en una playa caribeña. *Risa*"
    sca "If you don't mind, I will join you. While the whale is getting tested, I'll be able to show off my figure on a Caribbean beach. *Laugh*."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2221
translate english c18s003_Daphne_07f0ea1c:

    # mc "Eres bienvenida, pero no te recomiendo llamar ballena a una mujer embarazada. *Risa*"
    mc "You're welcome, but I don't recommend calling a pregnant woman a whale. *Laugh*"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2223
translate english c18s003_Daphne_e07eddda_1:

    # "Os volvéis a abrazar los tres. El día ha empezado bien para [dap]."
    "You hug each other again, the three of you. The day has started nicely for [dap]."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2226
translate english c18s003_Daphne_18850f16_1:

    # dap "Negativo."
    dap "Negative."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2227
translate english c18s003_Daphne_7cf3844e:

    # mc "¿Decepcionada?"
    mc "Disappointed?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2229
translate english c18s003_Daphne_46e31e90:

    # dap "Para nada. Ya te dije ayer que nunca había pensado en quedarme embarazada a los 18."
    dap "Not at all. I told you yesterday that I had never thought about getting pregnant at 18."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2230
translate english c18s003_Daphne_7ab3155e:

    # dap "Mañana es otra cosa, ya tendré 19. *Risa* Y si llega a los 20 o a los 23 da lo mismo. Lo divertido son los intentos."
    dap "Tomorrow is a different story, I'll be 19. *Laugh* And whether the pregnancy comes at 20 or 23 is all the same. It's the trying that's fun."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2231
translate english c18s003_Daphne_5a2bb053:

    # mc "Esa es la actitud."
    mc "That's the attitude."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2233
translate english c18s003_Daphne_116c78a0:

    # sca "Al menos no serás una ballena cuando vayamos a Aruba."
    sca "At least you won't be a whale when we go to Aruba."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2234
translate english c18s003_Daphne_a3b677a8:

    # mc "¿Aruba?"
    mc "Aruba?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2236
translate english c18s003_Daphne_f03fc7c0:

    # dap "Ya te dijimos que queríamos trabajar allí. Es muy pronto aún, tenemos que acabar las carreras... empezarlas para ser más exactos."
    dap "We already told you we wanted to work there. It's too early yet, we have to finish our degrees... start them to be more precise."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2237
translate english c18s003_Daphne_f7efe4f0:

    # dap "Pero queremos acompañarte cuando vayas, para ver las instalaciones, empezar a aprender cómo funciona todo y aprovechar el verano."
    dap "But we want to join you when you go there, to see the facilities, start learning how everything works, and make the most out of the summer."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2239
translate english c18s003_Daphne_3f0d013b:

    # sca "No tenemos mucho que hacer hasta que no empiece el curso, con lo que nos ha parecido una buena idea."
    sca "We don't have much to do until the college year starts, so it sounded like a good idea."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2240
translate english c18s003_Daphne_272eb721:

    # sca "Al menos pasar unos días allí hasta que te asientes. No te sentirás tan solo."
    sca "At least spend a few days there until you settle in. That way you won't feel so lonely."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2241
translate english c18s003_Daphne_caa7b151:

    # mc "Me parece genial. Habría que hablarlo con Amanda y Eva, pero no creo que haya ningún problema. Pero ahora quiero un abrazo."
    mc "I think it's great. We'd have to talk it over with Amanda and Eva, but I don't think there would be any problems. But now I want a hug."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2243
translate english c18s003_Daphne_46c2079e:

    # "Los tres os fundís en un abrazo que inicia [dap] y al que se une Scarlett."
    "The three of you melt into an embrace that [dap] initiates and Scarlett joins in."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2247
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_96aa7fa7:

    # sca "¿Ha sido el mío? Me da miedo mirar..."
    sca "Was it mine? I'm afraid to look..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2248
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_87d401ed:

    # mc "Sabes que no hay una sola oportunidad, ¿verdad? Si no sale positivo a la primera..."
    mc "You know you don't get only one shot, right? If it doesn't come out positive the first time..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2252
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_98a5fb30:

    # sca "¡Positivo!"
    sca "Positive!"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2253
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_a60fd8f1:

    # mc "¡Ven aquí, Mamá!"
    mc "Come here, Mommy!"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2256
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_d2ac3aee:

    # mc "¿Pasa algo, mi amor? ¿No estás contenta?"
    mc "Is something wrong, my love? Are you not happy?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2257
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_38e664b6:

    # sca "No es eso..."
    sca "It's not that..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2260
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_bed9a5e7:

    # sca "No me malinterpretes... estoy contenta de llevar a nuestro hijo dentro..."
    sca "Don't get me wrong... I'm happy to be carrying our child..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2261
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_4c103678:

    # mc "Nadie lo podría adivinar, Scarlett. Parece que la noticia no te ha gustado."
    mc "No one could guess, Scarlett. Sounds like you didn't like the news."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2264
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_5ab2cc5d:

    # sca "Es posible que seamos hermanos y que este hijo sea endogámico. Me preocupa..."
    sca "It is possible that we are siblings and that this child is endogamous. I am worried..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2268
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_63768574:

    # sca "Sé que [mar] va a estar ahí para nuestro bebé, y que [nor] va a actuar también de abuela. Y que va a tener muchas tías."
    sca "I know [mar] is going to be there for our baby, and that [nor] is going to act as a grandmother too. And that she's going to have a lot of aunts."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2269
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_a0938342:

    # mc "Y no te olvides de Meemaw y Tía Betty. Van a ser unas bisabuelas fantásticas."
    mc "And don't forget about Meemaw and Aunt Betty. They're going to be terrific great-grandmothers."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2270
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_00cc1e5f:

    # mc "Al menos cuando no estén en Florida."
    mc "At least when they're not in Florida."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2272
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_ffad69a8:

    # sca "Pero... me gustaría que... en algún momento se lo pudiéramos decir a mi madre."
    sca "But... I wish that... at some point we could tell my mother."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2273
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_6418d1c9:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Tal como te ha tratado?"
    mc "What? With how badly she treated you, do you really want to tell her?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2275
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_82a96e43:

    # dap "[mc], es su madre. ¿No se lo vas a contar a Tío Edmund, por muy mal que se haya portado?"
    dap "[mc], it's her mother. You're not going to tell Uncle Edmund, no matter how bad he's acted?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2278
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_3a161190:

    # mc "Si por mí fuera, esperaría como mínimo a tener los resultados del test de ADN."
    mc "If it were up to me, I would at the very least wait for the DNA test results."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2280
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_865718ea:

    # mc "Si por mí fuera, esperaría un tiempo antes de decírselo, a que se calmen las aguas."
    mc "If it were up to me, I'd wait a while before telling her, until the dust settles."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2283
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_736e64cc:

    # sca "Me parece una buena idea. Si somos medio hermanos... creo que podría decir cosas muy feas. Al menos iremos preparados. Y no es que tenga ganas de verla ahora mismo."
    sca "I think it's a good idea. If we're half- siblings... I think she might say some pretty nasty things. At least we'll go there ready. And it's not like I feel like seeing her right now anyway."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2285
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_2574a128:

    # sca "Me parece una buena idea. No tengo ganas de verla ahora mismo."
    sca "Sounds like a good idea. I don't feel like seeing her right now anyway."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2286
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_f24e11ee:

    # sca "De todas formas, no tenía intención de contárselo enseguida. Primero se lo quiero contar a nuestra familia."
    sca "Besides, I didn't intend to tell her right away. I want to tell our family first."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2288
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_87c40627:

    # mc "Ya te lo he dicho. Si quieres contárselo, no voy a poner ningún impedimento."
    mc "I've already told you. If you want to tell her, I'm not going to raise any objections."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2291
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_7324dc5d:

    # dap "¿Puede Tía [dap] pedir un abrazo de los futuros padres?"
    dap "Can Auntie [dap] ask for a hug from the parents-to-be?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2294
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_53e40ed6:

    # sca "Ahora solo falta ver el de [dap]. Yo también quiero ser tía."
    sca "Now we just need to see [dap]'s'. I want to be an aunt too."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2295
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_31214d4f:

    # dap "No tengo prisa en que pite. Se está muy bien aquí. Ese test de embarazo va a ser el mejor regalo de cumpleaños que voy a recibir hoy."
    dap "I'm in no hurry for it to beep. It's really nice in here. Your pregnancy test is going to be the best birthday present I'm going to get today."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2297
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_35f100d5:

    # dap "A veces me dais mucha envidia. Después pienso en que voy a poder jugar con el bebé y se me pasa."
    dap "Sometimes you make me so envious. Then I think about how I'm going to get to play with the baby and it slips away."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2298
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_da69abcb:

    # dap "Ese test de embarazo va a ser el mejor regalo de cumpleaños que voy a recibir hoy."
    dap "That pregnancy test is going to be the best birthday present I'm going to get today."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2299
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_974421d2:

    # mc "*Risa* Espero que no, pero ya tenemos una voluntaria para cambiar pañales, Scarlett."
    mc "*Laugh* I hope not, but we already have a volunteer to change diapers, Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2300
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_3f97664c:

    # sca "*Risa* Creo que [dap] será la primera persona del mundo que se lea en profundidad el manual de los pañales y lo modifique para hacerlo más eficiente."
    sca "*Laugh* I think [dap] will be the first person in the world to read the diaper manual in depth, and modify it to make it more efficient."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2301
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_8843c9a6:

    # dap "¡Puagh! Quiero jugar con el bebé. *Risa* Los pañales son cosa vuestra. Pero sí que me leeré el manual."
    dap "Puagh! I want to play with the baby. *Laugh* Diapers are your business. But yes, I will read the manual."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2304
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_2ed5da58:

    # sca "¡Negativo!"
    sca "Negative!"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2305
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_ce105bff:

    # mc "Ven aquí. Dame un abrazo y un beso."
    mc "Come here. Give me a hug and a kiss."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2308
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_db1134ff:

    # mc "No te pongas triste, habrá más oportunidades."
    mc "Don't be sad, there will be more opportunities."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2309
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_38e664b6_1:

    # sca "No es eso..."
    sca "It's not that..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2312
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_aeda7f1c:

    # sca "No me malinterpretes, me hubiera gustado quedarme embarazada... pero casi prefiero que no haya pasado."
    sca "Don't get me wrong, I would have liked to have gotten pregnant... but I'm almost happy it hadn't happened."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2313
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_ba5aaef9:

    # mc "¿Por qué? ¿Hay algo que deba saber?"
    mc "Why? Is there something I should know?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2316
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_64584875:

    # sca "Aún no sabemos los resultados del test de embarazo. Es posible que este bebé hubiera sido endogámico."
    sca "We do not yet know the results of the DNA test. It is possible that this baby could actually be endogamic."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2320
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_2d41f174:

    # sca "Sé que [mar] estaría ahí para nuestro bebé, y que [nor] actuaría también de abuela. Y que tendría muchas tías."
    sca "I know that [mar] would be there for our baby, and that [nor] would also act as a grandmother. And that she would have a lot of aunts."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2321
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_e99a63f0:

    # mc "Y no te olvides de Meemaw y Tía Betty. Serían unas bisabuelas fantásticas."
    mc "And don't forget about Meemaw and Aunt Betty. They would make fantastic great-grandmothers."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2322
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_00cc1e5f_1:

    # mc "Al menos cuando no estén en Florida."
    mc "At least when they're not in Florida."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2324
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_15a556d7:

    # sca "Pero... me gustaría que... si en algún momento pasa, se lo pudiéramos decir a mi madre."
    sca "But... I wish that... if it ever happens, we could tell my mother."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2325
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_6418d1c9_1:

    # mc "¿Qué? ¿Tal como te ha tratado?"
    mc "What? With how badly she treated you, do you really want to tell her?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2327
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_7cf92379:

    # dap "[mc], es su madre. ¿No se lo contarías a Tío Edmund, por muy mal que se haya portado?"
    dap "[mc], it's her mother. Won't you tell Uncle Edmund, no matter how bad he's acted?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2330
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_0d19a8e7:

    # mc "Pero si hubiera salido positivo hoy, esperaría como mínimo a tener los resultados del test de ADN."
    mc "But if the test had turned positive today, I would have at the very least waited for the DNA test results."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2332
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_de601e4a:

    # mc "Pero si hubiera salido positivo hoy, esperaría un tiempo antes de decírselo, a que se calmen las aguas."
    mc "But if it had turned out positive today, I would have waited a while before telling her, for the dust to settle."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2335
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_7f007538:

    # sca "Me parece una buena idea. Si somos medio hermanos... creo que podría decir cosas muy feas. Al menos iríamos preparados."
    sca "I think that's a good idea. If we're half- siblings... I think she might say some pretty nasty things. At least we'd go prepared."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2337
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_2574a128_1:

    # sca "Me parece una buena idea. No tengo ganas de verla ahora mismo."
    sca "Sounds like a good idea. I don't feel like seeing her right now anyway."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2338
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_6c0c04ea:

    # sca "De todas formas, no tenía intención de contárselo enseguida. Primero se lo hubiera querido contar a nuestra familia."
    sca "Besides, I didn't intend to tell her right away. I would have wanted to tell our family first."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2340
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_1a6a26a4:

    # mc "Ya te lo he dicho. Si, cuando pase, quieres contárselo, no voy a poner ningún impedimento."
    mc "I've already told you. If, when it happens, you want to tell her, I'm not going to raise any objection."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2343
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_70a401d3:

    # dap "¿Puede la futura Tía [dap] pedir un abrazo de los futuros padres?"
    dap "Can the future Aunt [dap] ask for a hug from the future parents?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2346
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_94124824:

    # sca "Ahora solo falta ver el de [dap]. A mí me gustaría saber hoy que voy a ser tía."
    sca "Now we just need to wait for [dap]'s. I'd like to know today that I'm going to be an aunt."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2347
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_118ef7b0:

    # dap "No tengo prisa en que pite. Se está muy bien aquí. Ese test de embarazo podría haber sido el mejor regalo de cumpleaños que iba a recibir hoy."
    dap "I'm in no hurry for it to beep. It's nice in here. That pregnancy test might have been the best birthday present I was going to get today."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2348
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_0096e533:

    # dap "Veros superar las dudas han superado a cualquier posible positivo. Y ese bebé llegará tarde o temprano."
    dap "Seeing you overcome your doubts have outweighed any possible positives. And that baby will come sooner or later."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2350
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_12f7b571:

    # dap "A veces me dais mucha envidia. Después pienso en que voy a poder jugar con el bebé cuando [mc] apunte bien con sus soldaditos y se me pasa."
    dap "Sometimes you guys make me so envious. Then I think about how I'm going to be able to play with the baby when [mc] takes good aim with his little soldiers and it goes away."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2351
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_73953127:

    # dap "Ese test de embarazo podría haber sido el mejor regalo de cumpleaños que iba a recibir hoy."
    dap "That pregnancy test might have been the best birthday present I was going to get today."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2352
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_fdd4419b:

    # mc "*Risa* Espero que no, pero ya tenemos una voluntaria para cambiar pañales cuando llegue el bebé, Scarlett."
    mc "*Laugh* I hope not, but we already have a volunteer to change diapers when the baby arrives, Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2353
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_3f97664c_1:

    # sca "*Risa* Creo que [dap] será la primera persona del mundo que se lea en profundidad el manual de los pañales y lo modifique para hacerlo más eficiente."
    sca "*Laugh* I think [dap] will be the first person in the world to read the diaper manual in depth, and modify it to make it more efficient."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2354
translate english c18s003_Scarlett_d0714078:

    # dap "¡Puagh! He dicho jugar con el bebé. *Risa* Los pañales son cosa vuestra. Pero sí que me leeré el manual."
    dap "Puagh! I said play with the baby. *Laugh* Diapers are your business. But yes, I will read the manual."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2358
translate english c18s003_convScar1_b2dbd1ed:

    # "Os fundís en un abrazo y un beso..."
    "You melt in an embrace and a kiss..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2359
translate english c18s003_convScar1_3527cb31:

    # "Pero es un beso dubitativo. Algo le pasa a Scarlett."
    "But it's a hesitant kiss. Something's wrong with Scarlett."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2363
translate english c18s003_convScar2_744507d3:

    # dap "Díselo. Lo va a entender."
    dap "Tell him. He will understand."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2364
translate english c18s003_convScar2_eb04d957:

    # mc "¿Qué me estáis ocultando? Habíamos quedado en hablarlo todo, ¿no?"
    mc "What are you hiding from me? We agreed to talk about anything, didn't we?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2368
translate english c18s003_convScar3_9ed741bb:

    # sca "[dap] y yo hemos estado hablando sobre qué pasaría si salía positivo..."
    sca "[dap] and I have been talking about what would happen if it came out positive...."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2372
translate english c18s003_convScar4_6c7fc95b:

    # dap "Yo le he dicho que la endogamia en primera generación no tiene prácticamente riesgos."
    dap "I have told you that first-generation inbreeding is virtually risk-free."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2373
translate english c18s003_convScar4_cefa98c1:

    # mc "¿De qué riesgos estamos hablando?"
    mc "What risks are we talking about?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2375
translate english c18s003_convScar4_046926f6:

    # dap "Negligibles. Los riesgos aumentan a partir de la tercera generación endogámica."
    dap "Negligible. Risks increase from the third inbred generation onward."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2376
translate english c18s003_convScar4_ec7530ee:

    # dap "Cuarta en vuestro caso ya que solo seríais medio hermanos. Si es que lo sois."
    dap "Fourth in your case since you would only be half siblings. If you are."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2378
translate english c18s003_convScar4_4299d6b8:

    # sca "Lo sé, pero eso no hace que me vaya a preocupar menos..."
    sca "I know, but that doesn't make me worry any less..."

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2379
translate english c18s003_convScar4_03de3da7:

    # mc "¿No crees que vas un poco rápido con las preocupaciones?"
    mc "Don't you think you're going a little fast with the worries?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2381
translate english c18s003_convScar4_aad0753a:

    # sca "¿A qué te refieres?"
    sca "What do you mean?"

# game/scripts/c18/c18.rpy:2382
translate english c18s003_convScar4_de74ba43:

    # mc "A que aún no sabemos si somos medio hermanos. Creo que no vale la pena preocuparse por los \"qué pasaría si...?\" hasta que no tengamos los resultados."
    mc " We don't know yet if we are half siblings. I don't think it's worth worrying about the \"what ifs\" until we have the results."

